	('0eMLq6CSMnw', 'remap', 'What It''s Like Being a Reporter Covering Trump in 2025', 'Folks, the Chicago Cubs are really good right now. Which is why we had to invite 404 Media''s Jason Koebler on to talk about how much it sucks to be a fan of his team, the disappointing Baltimore Orioles. In the first half of the podcast, though, we talk about 404 Media’s excellent reporting on tech’s takeover of politics, the rise of Silicon Valley on the right, the newfound obsession over the R-word in those circles, and more.

