	('C90x90Gtap4', 'remap', 'The State of Nintendo With Kat Bailey', 'It’s been nearly two months since the launch of the Switch 2. With the release of Donkey Kong Bananza, it felt like a good time to have a long and focused discussion on what Nintendo is trying to accomplish with the Switch 2, why the company feels a little more boring these days, and what it means to conceptualize a future without figures like Miyamoto leading the charge. To have this discussion, Patrick is joined by Kat Bailey (Axe of the Blood God, Nintenkats). If you enjoy this podcast, let us know! Patrick’s considering doing one for every platform holder. 

What you''re listening to is an episode from Remap Radio! Subscribe to the podcast: https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/remap-radio/id1690437343

